  values ('ME', 'passage', 'Case I: Landscaping for Gelephu Mindfulness City
Every Bhutanese is aware of the upcoming developments in Gelephu Mindfulness City (GMC). In developed countries, landscaping and beautification are integral to urban planning and environmental management.

1. What are some key aspects of aesthetic interventions in developed cities? (15 marks)', 'Key aspects: green infrastructure - parks, tree-lined streets, green corridors, roof and vertical gardens that cool the city and improve air; attractive public spaces and streetscapes - plazas, wide footpaths, benches, lighting, signage and public art; blue infrastructure - riverfronts, ponds, fountains and rain gardens combining beauty with storm-water management; seasonal and native planting with colourful floral displays at entrances, roundabouts and civic buildings; preserving heritage and local identity in landscape design; cleanliness, waste management and regular maintenance; accessibility for all; integration with urban planning through design codes and green-space standards; and community participation in caring for spaces.', null, '[{"point": "Green infrastructure: parks, street trees, green corridors, roof/ vertical gardens", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Public spaces and streetscape: plazas, walkable streets, furniture, lighting, public art", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Water features/ blue infrastructure, rain gardens, riverfronts", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Native/ seasonal planting, floral displays, maintenance and cleanliness, heritage/ identity", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Planning integration: design codes, sustainability, accessibility, community participation", "marks": 3}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'subject-specialisation'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'subject-specialisation') and t.slug = 'beautification-officer'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-technical-3'), 'standard', 15,
