  values ('ME', 'passage', 'Case I: Landscaping for Gelephu Mindfulness City
Every Bhutanese is aware of the upcoming developments in Gelephu Mindfulness City (GMC). In developed countries, landscaping and beautification are integral to urban planning and environmental management.

3. What challenges do you anticipate in implementing urban landscaping in GMC? (15 marks)', 'Climate and site: hot, humid summers, heavy monsoon rain and flooding, pests and diseases, and the need to choose plants that suit the subtropical climate and avoid invasive species. Resources: high costs of establishment and long-term maintenance; shortage of trained landscape architects, horticulturists and gardeners; limited supply of quality planting material locally. Planning and coordination: rapid, large-scale development by many investors and agencies may outpace landscape planning; land-use conflicts; need for clear design codes and enforcement. Environmental: balancing landscaping with water use and drainage, protecting existing forests, biodiversity and wildlife corridors (elephants), managing green waste. Social: getting public participation and a sense of ownership, preventing damage and vandalism, and sustaining maintenance after the initial investment.', null, '[{"point": "Climate: heat, monsoon floods, pests/ diseases, invasive species, plant selection", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Resources: funding, maintenance costs, skilled landscape professionals, planting material supply", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Planning: land use conflicts, coordination among agencies/ investors, design standards, scale/ speed", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Environment: water management, biodiversity/ elephants/ wildlife corridors, sustainability, waste", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Social: public participation, ownership, vandalism, long-term upkeep", "marks": 3}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'subject-specialisation'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'subject-specialisation') and t.slug = 'beautification-officer'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-technical-3'), 'standard', 15,
    1620, 'historical_official', 'awaiting_review',
    null, null,
